{"answer_text":"Small agencies usually combine a CRM for new business with a project tool for delivery. Common choices:\n\n**Northwind CRM Essentials**\nPowerful and well supported, though per-seat costs climb quickly past the starter tier.\n\n**Halcyon Sales**\nA sales-engagement tool with a CRM attached; sequences and call tasks are its strength.\n\n**Pipewell**\nEasy to adopt, but email features cost extra.\n\nStart with Northwind CRM if you want the quickest setup; shortlist Halcyon Sales if you expect to need deeper reporting.\n\nLedgerline's 2026 roundup ranks most of these near the top as well.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-5107-74ae-922d-c65c3cd4caca","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.006,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:02:22.450Z","engine":"google_ai_mode","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["agency new business pipeline tool","agency client management tools","crm for small agencies"],"latency_ms":11800,"location_applied":true,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a2eb448ab7","market_name":"Canada","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889a7fe6de41","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":null,"method":"alias","name":"Northwind CRM","name_text":"Northwind CRM","offsets":[[107,120],[401,414]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889c3d4225fd","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":null,"method":"alias","name":"Halcyon Sales","name_text":"Halcyon Sales","offsets":[[225,238],[457,470]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889b1141e640","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":null,"method":"alias","name":"Pipewell","name_text":"Pipewell","offsets":[[332,340]],"pos":3,"recommended":false,"re